<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Dec wholesale prices up 14.41 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Dec wholesale prices up 14.41 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 14.41 percent in December year-on-year, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Sunday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 1.39 percent to 199.53 from 196.79 in November. The index stood at 174.40 in December 1995.</p>
<p>					  Dec	Nov	   Dec 1995</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICE  base 1990/91  199.53   196.79	  174.40</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +1.39    +2.38	    n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +14.41   +13.23	  +12.86</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
</text>
